## each '>>> referenced by <file>:(main)'.
# ERRS-COUNT-46:   {{^}}msil-ld: error: {{.+}}
# REFS-COUNT-46:   {{^}}>>> referenced by [[OBJ]]:(main){{$}}
# ANYREF-COUNT-46: {{^}}>>>
## The implicit patterns of the TABLE run nowhere in the file: for a prefix
## made only of -DAG lines, --implicit-check-not checks only the text before
## the first match, and a COUNT line does not check them between its matches.
# TABLE-NONE-NOT: PLEASE submit
# TABLE-NONE-NOT: Stack dump
# TABLE-NONE-NOT: LLVM ERROR
# TABLE-NONE-NOT: undefined symbol
# TABLE-NONE-NOT: pinvokeimpl

## No error: an explicit import, a bitcode definition, a dead reference.
